fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gstlcevcmeta.html#gst_buffer_get_lcevc_meta","fragment":"\n\tgst_buffer_get_lcevc_meta\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.prototype.buffer_get_lcevc_meta\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.buffer_get_lcevc_meta\n\nFind the GstLcevcMeta on buffer with the lowest id.\nBuffers can contain multiple GstLcevcMeta metadata items when dealing with\nmultiview buffers.\nParameters:\na GstBuffer\nthe GstLcevcMeta with lowest id (usually 0) or NULL when there\nis no such metadata on buffer.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nFind the GstCodecParsers.LcevcMeta on buffer with the lowest id.\nBuffers can contain multiple GstCodecParsers.LcevcMeta metadata items when dealing with\nmultiview buffers.\nParameters:\na Gst.Buffer\nthe GstCodecParsers.LcevcMeta with lowest id (usually 0) or null when there\nis no such metadata on buffer.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nFind the GstCodecParsers.LcevcMeta on buffer with the lowest id.\nBuffers can contain multiple GstCodecParsers.LcevcMeta metadata items when dealing with\nmultiview buffers.\nParameters:\na Gst.Buffer\nthe GstCodecParsers.LcevcMeta with lowest id (usually 0) or None when there\nis no such metadata on buffer.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});